{"channelId":"UC5-taROAAhEKOsYG8cukcFA","row":["Bellin College",420,"Founded in 1909, Bellin College has a distinguished reputation for providing students with a quality education which prepares them for the demands of the rapidly changing health care environment. The College has continually restructured its nursing program and also added a radiologic sciences program to meet health care changes. This devotion is seen in Bellin College's rich heritage and commitment to nursing and education. \r\n\r\nBellin College is dedicated to preparing health-care professionals by providing an intellectually stimulating environment focused on leadership, community service, and lifelong learning that promotes excellence in health-care practice and the advancement of the profession.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5-taROAAhEKOsYG8cukcFA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5-taROAAhEKOsYG8cukcFA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:18:28.453Z","channelId":"UC5-taROAAhEKOsYG8cukcFA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"a7f20a9ef4cbfae1b3c0a2be8c98e4ec5ffa9b26fc23bc981f6d8b4baf6bee0f","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"389581d84995260faadc58d13d90aac3ee24ef1dcfbefa610a9e73e9b40dee1f"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5-taROAAhEKOsYG8cukcFA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:18:28.453Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5-taROAAhEKOsYG8cukcFA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":420,"raw":"420 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5-taROAAhEKOsYG8cukcFA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:18:28.453Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"physical therapist","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"single_sample","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com